WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.201
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:02.201 --> 00:00:03.703
We are hanging out with
one of the best to ever do it.

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.438
Helen Mirren, right there,
ladies and gentlemen!

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:08.308
That's what I'm talking about!
In a bubble bath!

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:11.411
You are so -- You are the best.
-I'm getting pinker and pinker.

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:15.047
-I love you.
I want to talk about "F9."

00:00:15.047 --> 00:00:17.550
This is your third film in the

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.886
"Fast and Furious" franchise.

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:22.054
And I know you're not really
allowed to tell me much,

00:00:22.054 --> 00:00:25.792
but I've seen, in the trailer,
you're driving, finally.

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:27.093
-I drive, finally.

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.394
-Yeah.
-Finally.

00:00:28.394 --> 00:00:32.732
I begged to drive in the
first one and the second one.

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:35.601
They put me in the back of an
ambulance and then in jail,

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:37.236
so I had no chance of driving.

00:00:37.236 --> 00:00:41.641
And I whined and moaned enough
that they finally let me drive.

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:43.409
But, wow, what a drive.

00:00:43.409 --> 00:00:46.880
Incredible drive down the mall
towards Buckingham Palace.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.681
The last time
I went to Buckingham Palace,

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:51.717
I was in the back of a taxi,
going to get my damehood.

00:00:51.717 --> 00:00:54.353
-Wow! Isn't that wild.

00:00:54.353 --> 00:00:56.389
What -- I mean,
is this true that

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:59.526
you went up to Vin Diesel at
some awards show or something

00:00:59.526 --> 00:01:01.561
and you said,
"Hey, I love 'Fast and Furious.'

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:03.662
I know you produce it.
Get me in that thing."

00:01:03.662 --> 00:01:06.165
-Oh, I did. No, I begged.
I was shameless.

00:01:06.165 --> 00:01:07.499
No, absolutely.

00:01:07.499 --> 00:01:10.336
I begged, I whined, I moaned,
I cried a little bit.

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:14.207
You know, I pulled every trick
that I could possibly pull, yes.

00:01:14.207 --> 00:01:17.910
And he very, very kindly
acquiesced.

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:19.244
-Yeah, he's a good guy.

00:01:19.244 --> 00:01:23.516
In the film, you play Queenie,
obviously, and that --

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:26.218
-Yes, Queenie named after
my auntie Queenie.

00:01:26.218 --> 00:01:28.521
My mom came from
a big East End family.

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:30.623
There were 14 kids
in the family.

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:33.193
And, you know, West Ham,

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:35.895
for Londoners out there
know what that is.

00:01:35.895 --> 00:01:38.298
So, it was a very old
London family.

00:01:38.298 --> 00:01:40.366
And I had an Auntie Queenie.

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:43.035
And it's an old
East End name, Queenie.

00:01:43.035 --> 00:01:45.204
So I thought that would be a
good name for her to have.

00:01:45.204 --> 00:01:47.206
-I want to show everyone
a clip of you.

00:01:47.206 --> 00:01:49.642
Here is Helen Mirren
and Vin Diesel in "F9."

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:50.910
Take a look at this.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:53.012
-Well, it did go wrong on a crew
that just turned up,

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:54.480
led by an American.

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:55.648
[ Tires screech ]

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:57.517
♪♪

00:02:00.686 --> 00:02:02.688
This geezer was
about your height, actually.

00:02:02.688 --> 00:02:05.158
Similar features.

00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:07.026
Oh, bloody hell.

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:08.961
He's not your cousin
or something, is he?

00:02:08.961 --> 00:02:10.997
-He's my brother.

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:13.466
♪♪

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:14.800
[ Siren wailing ]

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:17.103
-Tether your brake
for me, would you, darling?

00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:28.781
Glad I'm not the only one with
a family full of eccentrics.

00:02:28.781 --> 00:02:33.152
♪♪

00:02:33.152 --> 00:02:34.587
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:36.589
-That is how
you do it right there!

00:02:36.589 --> 00:02:39.559
That is how you do it!
Helen Mirren, everybody!

00:02:39.559 --> 00:02:43.763
"F9" hits theaters
Friday, June 25th!

